      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5156 - Jamil narrated from Abu Abdullah (as), who said:\n\"The Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace be upon him and his family) cursed the one who commits an offense in Medina or shelters an offender.\"\nI asked: \"What is this offense?\"\nImam (as) said: \"It is killing.\""
